            "review_title": "Review at Glamour Bar",
            "review_text": "skalala\nMarseille, France1 contribution\n0\nDangerous tourist trap: Price scam, extortion, and intimidation\nSep 2026 • Solo\nDo not trust the positive ratings on Google Maps or other platforms and stay away.\nI had the worst experience at Ho Chi Minh City in that bar.\nIt is a well-oiled tourist trap and a complete financial scam from start to finish.\nTheir tactic is always the same: you are encouraged to enter with promises of normal prices, but things escalate as soon as you are inside. Staff and affiliates attempt to get you to order unlisted, outrageously overpriced drinks.\nThe moment you refuse to pay these unjustified extras or try to leave, they alter the bill and multiply the prices without your consent. If you contest the fraudulent charges, the staff's attitude turns hostile immediately. The tone shifts, the atmosphere becomes aggressive.\nBy the way, never accept to pay before any service or you won't receive it. I experienced it.\nThis is pure extortion carried out by dishonest individuals taking advantage of foreign travelers. Never set foot in this establishment, do not hand over your credit card, and warn others. Your safety and money are at risk.\nRead more\nWritten September 22, 2026",
